  "core_idea": "Social institutions such as politics, religion and education increasingly depend on and adapt to the media and their logic, which changes how these institutions work.",
  "key_concepts_note": "Use the concepts already stored for this theory in the library (theories.concepts).",
  "when_to_use": [
    "How do politics, religion or universities change because of media and social media?",
    "How do organisations adapt to media logic?",
    "Typical data: case studies, interviews, document analysis, longitudinal analysis."
  ],
  "common_mistakes": [
